20616      data survey; call streaminit(722); do stratum=1 to 2; do cluster=1 to 4; do id=1 to 12; age=20+mod(id*7+cluster,45); event=rand('bernoulli',0.3);
20616    ! weight=2+stratum+cluster/10; output; end; end; end; run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVEY has 96 observations and 6 variables.

20617      proc surveylogistic data=survey; strata stratum; cluster cluster; weight weight; model event(event='1')=age; run;

NOTE: PROC SURVEYLOGISTIC is modeling the probability that event=1.
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYLOGISTIC printed page 1409.

